  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5385188510902670098}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ba2ac043a0776a4d846aaf6ba38a734, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: MixerStand(Kitchen)
  description: "This is the MixerStand. \r\nThe user can use this mixerstand to create
    the cake batter.\r\nTo do it, the user first need to put batter material in the
    mixer cup.\r\nBatter material are flour, egg and butter. The user need to put
    material in order of floue egg butter or flour butter egg.\r\nTo start the mixer,
    the user can place cup in mixerstand.\r\nThen by pressing the mixer head down,
    the mixer will start. But if the mixer cup does not have enough material, it
    will not start to mix.\r\nTo check the status of mixer cup, please read the documentation
    component of mixer cup.\r\nIf the user don't know how to start the mixerstand,
    you can use the function calling 'playVideoClip' and give 'MixTheBatter' as Text
    Input. Then this function will enable a videoclip how to start mixer. So the
    user can understand how to start the mixerstand."
  type: 0
  url: 
